Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.63,0:01:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,底比斯 繁华之都\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thebes, city of the living.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.60,0:01:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,法老塞提一世的冠上宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crown jewel of pharaoh seti the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.23,0:01:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,法老的大祭司 亡灵的看守人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home of imhotep, pharaoh's high priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.34,0:01:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莫顿的家乡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeper of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.58,0:01:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,法老的宠妾 禁脔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Birthplace of ancksunamun, pharaoh's mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.01,0:01:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,安苏娜的出生地\N{\fnArial\fs30}No other man was allowed to touch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.34,0:01:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,两人为了爱情 宁愿牺牲一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for their love, they were willing to risk life itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.83,0:02:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在这里干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.52,0:02:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁碰过你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who has touched you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.96,0:02:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莫顿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imhotep?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.90,0:02:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的祭司\N{\fnArial\fs30}My priest!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.55,0:03:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,法老的侍卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pharaoh's bodyguards.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.55,0:03:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快走！不要管我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must go! Save yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.25,0:03:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.09,0:03:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你才能让我复活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only you can resurrect me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.69,0:03:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能丢下你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't leave you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.33,0:03:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.73,0:03:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定不会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shall live again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.67,0:03:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will resurrect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.34,0:03:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的身体已经另有所属\N{\fnArial\fs30}My body is no longer his temple!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.48,0:03:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了让安苏娜复活\N{\fnArial\fs30}To resurrect ancksunamun,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.65,0:03:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莫顿率领手下闯入墓穴把尸体偷运出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imhotep and his priests broke into her crypt and stole her body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.99,0:03:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们风驰电掣 深入大漠\N{\fnArial\fs30}They raced deep into the desert,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.33,0:03:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入哈姆纳塔 亡灵之城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking ancksunamun's corpse to hamunaptra, city of the dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.10,0:04:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,历代法老的陵寝…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ancient burial site for the sons of pharaohs…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.80,0:04:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,及其财富的陪葬地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And resting place for the wealth of egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.64,0:04:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莫顿为了爱人不惜怒犯天条 深入城内\N{\fnArial\fs30}For his love, imhotep dared the gods' anger by going deep into the city…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.85,0:04:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,把亡灵黑经从圣龕取了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where he took the black book of the dead from its holy resting place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.38,0:04:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,安苏娜的魂魄已经下到地府\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anck-su-namun's soul had been sent to the dark underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.62,0:04:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的五脏六腑被剜了出来分置于五个瓮内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her vital organs removed and placed in five sacred canopic jars.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.96,0:05:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,安苏娜的魂魄被招了回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anck-su-namun's soul had come back from the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.23,0:05:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是紧追在后的侍卫突然闯进来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But pharaoh's bodyguards had followed imhotep and stopped him…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.06,0:05:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,打断了招魂仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before the ritual could be completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.35,0:05:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的僧侣因罪被活生生制成木乃伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imhotep's priests were condemned to be mummifiied alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.23,0:05:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于伊莫顿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}As for imhotep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.23,0:05:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被判接受「虫噬」\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was condemned to endure the hom-dai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.90,0:05:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,古代诅咒中最恶毒的一种\N{\fnArial\fs30}The worst of all ancient curses,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.60,0:05:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为太过恐怖所以从未施行过\N{\fnArial\fs30}One so horrible it had never before been bestowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.54,0:06:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的灵魂生生世世…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was to remain sealed inside his sarcophagus…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.22,0:06:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,被密封于石棺之内\N{\fnArial\fs30}The undead for all of eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.22,0:06:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,受到袄教僧侣看守\N{\fnArial\fs30}The magi would never allow him to be released,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.22,0:06:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦他被释放将化为祸害人间…\N{\fnArial\fs30}For he would arise a walking disease, a plague upon mankind,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.36,0:06:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥有千年法力的妖孽\N{\fnArial\fs30}An unholy flesh eater with the strength of ages,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.66,0:06:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,力量笼罩这片土地所向无敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power over the sands And the glory of invincibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.77,0:07:00.44,Title,0,0,0,0,,《木乃伊》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.59,0:07:21.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1923年 哈姆纳塔）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.47,0:07:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,三千年来 地上兵戎不断\N{\fnArial\fs30}For 3, 000 years men and armies fought over this land,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.94,0:07:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下妖气暗涌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never knowing what evil lay beneath it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.06,0:07:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,而三千年来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for 3, 000 years…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.06,0:07:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是法老侍卫的后代 世代看守着此处\N{\fnArial\fs30}We, the magi, the descendants of pharaoh's sacred bodyguards, kept watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.08,0:08:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你升职了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just got promoted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.61,0:08:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,预备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prenez vos positions!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.32,0:08:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,沉住气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.32,0:08:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会临阵脱逃吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're with me on this one, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.52,0:08:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的勇气给了我力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Your strength gives me strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.59,0:08:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,沉住气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.83,0:08:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下！等等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.34,0:08:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,沉住气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.31,0:08:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.76,0:10:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑 班尼 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run, beni! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.76,0:10:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去！快进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get inside! Get inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.40,0:10:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 不可以关门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!Don't you close that door!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.51,0:10:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可以关门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you close that door!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.00,0:11:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物没有被发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}The creature remains undiscovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.27,0:11:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what of this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.86,0:12:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杀了他？- 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Should we kill him? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.96,0:12:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙漠会收拾他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The desert will kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.03,0:12:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,三年后的埃及开罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cairo, egypt 3 years later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.94,0:12:30.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（古物博物馆）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.68,0:12:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣石\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sacred stones."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.21,0:12:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,雕塑和美术\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sculpture and aesthetics."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.12,0:12:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏格拉底赛斯第一册 第二册…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Socrates, seth, volume one, volume two…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.12,0:12:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三册\N{\fnArial\fs30}And volume three.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.83,0:12:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And t…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.26,0:12:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,突司摩西斯王朝怎么会在这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tuthmosis? What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.57,0:12:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,T…T在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"T." "t, " "t, " "t, " "t."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.57,0:12:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"T."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.34,0:13:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把你放回原位\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to put you where you belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.96,0:13:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help. Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.30,0:13:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa-a-aaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.95,0:13:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.95,0:13:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么…怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What… howci…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.59,0:13:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hhow…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.60,0:14:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.17,0:14:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sons of the pharaohs!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.33,0:14:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁可要蝗虫 白蚁 老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me frogs! Flies! Locusts!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.44,0:14:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything but you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.44,0:14:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你比起来其他的灾难只是小儿科\N{\fnArial\fs30}Compared to you, the other plagues were a joy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.44,0:14:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉 是意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so very sorry.it was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.61,0:14:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉美西斯摧毁叙利亚那才是意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}My girl, when rameses destroyed syria, that was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.45,0:14:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…算是灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…are a catastrophe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.65,0:14:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我的图书馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at my library!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.09,0:14:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我干嘛要忍受你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do I put up with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.86,0:14:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要忍受我是因为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}W well, you put up with me because I can…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.93,0:14:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会读 会写古埃及文\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can read and write ancient egyptian,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.03,0:14:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还会解释僧侣用的象形文宇\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can I can decipher hieroglyphics and hieratic,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.27,0:14:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 我是方圆千英里以内\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, well, i am the only person within a thousand miles…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.97,0:14:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一知道该如何正确编码编目录的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows how to properly code and catalog this library, that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.51,0:14:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忍受你是因为你父母生前大力赞助本馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put up with you because your father and mother were our finest patrons.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.21,0:14:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿他们的灵魂安息\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why! Allah rest their souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.72,0:14:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管你要怎么收拾 要收拾多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I don't care how you do it, i don't care how long it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.29,0:15:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我收拾好就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straighten up this meshiver!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.54,0:15:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.33,0:15:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿杜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abdul?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.87,0:15:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,穆哈德？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mohammed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.17,0:15:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴布？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.03,0:16:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会尊重死者吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you no respect for the dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.70,0:16:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.90,0:16:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候我宁可加入他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But sometimes i'd rather like to join them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.54,0:16:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,要加入就快 不要害我像你一样失业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I wish you would do it before you ruin my career the way you've ruined yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.74,0:16:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.48,0:16:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲爱的…小妹 我要让你…知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear, sweet baby sister, I'll have you… Know…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.88,0:16:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的事业目前正要起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}That at this precise moment my career is on a high note.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.78,0:16:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,起飞？强纳森 我没心情陪你疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}"High note." ha! Jonathan, please, i'm really not in the mood for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.25,0:16:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚把图书馆弄得一团槽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just made a bit of a mess in the library,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.69,0:16:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,班桥学院又拒绝了我的申请\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the bembridge scholars have rejected my application form again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.26,0:16:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,说我在考古这行的经验不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say I don't have enough experience in the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.47,0:16:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有我啊！小妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll always have me, old mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.14,0:16:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我有东西可以逗你开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, i have just the thing to cheer you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.14,0:17:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 强纳森 又是那些不值钱的小东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, jonathan, not another worthless trinket.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.65,0:17:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你再弄来一件垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I have to take one more piece of junk to the curator to try and…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.82,0:17:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我…帮你出手…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sell for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.49,0:17:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪弄来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.49,0:17:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,在底比斯买来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}On a dig down in thebes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.26,0:17:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这辈子什么都没找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}My whole life i've never found anything, evy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.43,0:17:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 这次没看错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell me i've found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.63,0:17:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,强纳森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jonathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.10,0:17:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.44,0:17:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你找到东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you've found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.14,0:17:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看纪念碑上的花饰\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see the cartouche there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.15,0:17:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是塞提一世的王室封印我很确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the official royal seal of seti the first, i'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概吧！我有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps. Two questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.72,0:17:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是塞提一世？他有钱吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell was seti the first, and was he rich?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.72,0:17:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是l9王朝的第二位法老\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was the second pharaoh of the 19th dynasty,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.79,0:17:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说是历来最富有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said to be the wealthiest pharaoh of them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.86,0:17:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 这位老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. I like this fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.86,0:17:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢他 我查过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like him very much. I've already dated the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.03,0:17:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,地图有三千年的历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's almost 3, 000 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.03,0:17:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看这边的古埃及文…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you look at the hieratic just here,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.33,0:17:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是哈姆纳塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's hamunaptra.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.34,0:18:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 胡说八道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear god, don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.17,0:18:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是学者 不是寻宝的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're scholars, not treasure hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.64,0:18:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈姆纳塔是古代阿拉伯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hamunaptra's a myth told by ancient arab storytellers…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.64,0:18:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿来哄希腊游客的神话\N{\fnArial\fs30}To amuse greek and roman tourists.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.65,0:18:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听过那些 木乃伊保护该城的谣传\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know all the blather about the city being protected by the curse of a mummy,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.55,0:18:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我的研究让我相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my research has led me to believe…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.55,0:18:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那城市可能确实存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}That the city itself may have actually existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.99,0:18:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说的是那个哈姆纳特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we talking about the hamunaptra?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.09,0:18:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 亡灵之城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. The city of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.09,0:18:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说是早期法老的藏宝库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the earliest pharaohs were said to have hidden the wealth of egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.26,0:18:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 在一间庞大的地下室内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, in a big, underground treasure chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.10,0:18:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托 - 大家都听过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Heh! - Oh, come on. Everybody knows the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.37,0:18:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要法老下令启动机关…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The entire necropolis was rigged to sink into the sand on pharaoh's command.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.87,0:18:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,整座墓地就会带著宝藏 沉入沙中\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole place would disappear beneath the sand dunes, taking the treasure with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.78,0:18:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国人会认为 那是骗人的童话故事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the americans would say, it's all fairy tales and hokum…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.11,0:18:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪 着火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my goodness! Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.46,0:18:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,城市的位置被你烧掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've burnt it! You've burned off the part with the lost city.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.46,0:18:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得烧掉比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for the best, i'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.46,0:18:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多人浪费了一生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many men have wasted their lives…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.46,0:19:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,盲目的追寻哈姆纳塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the foolish pursuit of hamunaptra.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.83,0:19:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人找到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's ever found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.43,0:19:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分的人…一去不回\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most… Have never returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.07,0:19:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别站着 快进门来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, come! Step over the threshold.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.91,0:19:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎光临开罗监狱 我的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to cairo prison, my humble home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.44,0:19:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你是在底比斯买到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me that you got it on a dig down in thebes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.45,0:19:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听错了 你骗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I was mistaken. You lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.45,0:19:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对谁都说谎 向来一视同仁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lie to everybody. What makes you so special?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.45,0:19:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你妹妹 所以你更好骗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am your sister. That just makes you more gullible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.59,0:19:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在酒店从醉鬼身上偷来的 是顺手牵羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stole it from a drunk at the local casbah. Picked his pocket, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.65,0:19:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我不认为 别开玩笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I don't think it's a very good… Stop being so ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.06,0:19:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙为什么坐牢？这我就不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly is this man in prison for? This I do not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.39,0:19:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我听说你要来 已经问过他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when I heard that you were coming, I asked him that myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.43,0:19:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.93,0:19:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 他只是在找乐子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he was just looking for a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.07,0:19:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是从他身上偷来的？没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the man that you stole it from? Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.08,0:19:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如我们去吃午饭… 你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why don't we just go sniff out a spot of tiffin who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.95,0:19:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这婆娘是谁？- 婆娘？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And who's the broad? - "Broad"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.02,0:19:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是本地传教的人 来传福音的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just a local sort of missionary chap, spreading the good word.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.26,0:20:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我妹妹 伊芙 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is my sister evy. How do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.96,0:20:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她还不算太难看 - 你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, well.guess she's not a total loss. - I beg your pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.86,0:20:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back in a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.30,0:20:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,问他盒子的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask him about the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.30,0:20:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到了 喂 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, we have found uh, hello. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.20,0:20:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到你的魔术盒\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both found your puzzle box,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.81,0:20:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,想请教你一些问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we've come to ask you about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.54,0:20:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不对 - 不对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.55,0:20:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 你是来问我哈姆纳塔在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You came to ask me about hamunaptra.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.68,0:20:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道盒子和哈姆纳塔有关？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh. Shh. H-how do you know the box pertains to hamunaptra?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.19,0:20:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我就是在那里找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's where I was when I found it. I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.29,0:20:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么知道你不是在吹牛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how do we know that's not a load of pig's wallow?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.29,0:20:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.99,0:20:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不认识 我有一张大众脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. I've just got one of those faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.17,0:20:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的去过哈姆纳塔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were actually at hamunaptra?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.51,0:20:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我去过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.84,0:20:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你发誓？- 每天发\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You swear? - Every damn day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.01,0:20:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是那意思 我知道 我去过那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean that I know. I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.01,0:20:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞提的地盘 亡灵之城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seti's place. City of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.51,0:21:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,能告诉我怎么去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you tell me how to get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.99,0:21:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 确实的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the exact location.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.89,0:21:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想知道？- 想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want to know? - Well, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.59,0:21:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真的想知道？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you really want to know? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.40,0:21:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就把我弄出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then get me the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.01,0:21:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it, lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.84,0:21:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要带他去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they taking him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.85,0:21:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,绞刑台\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be hanged.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.18,0:21:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,看样子他找到乐子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently he had a very good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.06,0:21:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你一百镑 你放了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will give you 100 pounds to save this man's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.06,0:21:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你一百镑看他被吊死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madame, I would pay 100 pounds just to see him hang.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.50,0:21:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,两百镑 行刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two hundred pounds! Proceed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.73,0:21:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,三百镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three hundred pounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.63,0:21:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么最后要求？死猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any last requests, pig?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.87,0:21:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 把绳子松了 放我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Loosen the knot and let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.81,0:22:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么可能放他走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y ahemar! Of course we don't let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.65,0:22:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,五百镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five hundred pounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.25,0:22:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what else?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.82,0:22:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个寂寞的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a very lonely man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.46,0:22:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行刑 - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yalla tlak! - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.10,0:22:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈！他的脖子没有断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha! His neck did not break!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.57,0:22:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 现在我们得看他被勒死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, i'm so sorry. Now we must watch him strangle to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.15,0:22:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道哈姆纳塔的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows the location to hamunaptra.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.59,0:22:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你骗人 - 我才没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You lie. - I would never!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.96,0:22:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说这只恶心的猪知道亡灵之城在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you telling me this filthy, godless son of a pig knows where to find the city of the dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.66,0:22:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes! - Truly?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.63,0:22:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你放他下来我们就分你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! And if you cut him down, we will give you…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.37,0:23:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一成 - 五成\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ten percent. - Fifty percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.47,0:23:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 两成 - 四成\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Twenty. - Forty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.70,0:23:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 三成 - 两成半\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thirty! - Twenty five.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.71,0:23:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.98,0:23:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,放他下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh! Cut him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.76,0:23:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,开罗吉萨港\N{\fnArial\fs30}Giza port cai ro.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.03,0:23:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的会出现？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think he's going to show up?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.36,0:23:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然会 我的运气这么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, undoubtedly, knowing my luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.33,0:23:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是那种说话算话的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He may be a cowboy, but I know the breed. His word is his word.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.34,0:23:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他下流 粗鲁 根本就是无赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, personally I think he's filthy, rude, a complete scoundrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.84,0:23:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢他 在等我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like him one bit. Anyone I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.88,0:23:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.32,0:23:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,适合冒险的好日子 对不对？欧康诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smashing day for the start of an adventure, eh, o'connell?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.59,0:23:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊！好日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, smashing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.92,0:23:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家是自己人 我不会打你的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, i'd never steal from a partner… Partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.43,0:23:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,说起来 不好意恩…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That reminds me. No hard feelings about the…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.00,0:24:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没关系 常有的事 - 欧康诺先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no, no. Happens all the time. - Mr.O'connell.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.93,0:24:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可不可以向我保证绝对不是在吹牛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you look me in the eye and guarantee me this isn't some sort of a flimflam?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.30,0:24:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则的话 我警告你… 你警告我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if it is, I am warning you… you're warning me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.07,0:24:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 我告诉你 我的部队就是信以为真…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady, let me put it this way: my whole damn garrison believed in this so much…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.18,0:24:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,才会横越利比亚到埃及找那城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}That without orders, they marched halfway across libya and into egypt to find that city.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.02,0:24:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了以后 找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we got there, all we found…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.38,0:24:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是沙和血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was sand and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.62,0:24:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me get your bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.73,0:24:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.06,0:24:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,下流 粗鲁 根本就是无赖 不讨人喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Filthy, rude, a complete scoundrel. Nothing to like there at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.60,0:24:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位早\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bright good morning to all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.94,0:24:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪！你来干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.77,0:24:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来保护我的投资 多谢你的关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to protect my investment, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.56,0:25:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩斯 别玩眼镜了 切牌吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quit playin' with your glasses and cut the deck, burns.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.23,0:25:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有眼镜 我连牌都看不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without my glasses I can't see the deck to cut it, dave.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.24,0:25:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧康诺 我们欠一个牌搭子\N{\fnArial\fs30}O'connell, sit down. We could use another player.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.17,0:25:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只赌命 不赌钱 - 从不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I only gamble with my life, never my money. - Never?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.28,0:25:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌五百块我们比你先到哈姆纳塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I was to bet you $500 we get to hamunaptra before you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.98,0:25:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们在找哈姆纳塔？- 说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're looking for hamunaptra? - Damn straight we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.22,0:25:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说我们要去的？他说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who says we are? He does.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.95,0:25:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how 'bout it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.49,0:25:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌不赌？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it a bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.42,0:25:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赌就赌 - 你凭什么这么有把握？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, you're on. - What makes you so confident, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.70,0:25:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们又凭什么？- 我们有去过的人带路\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What makes you? - We got us a man who's actually been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.00,0:25:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,真巧 因为欧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what a coincidence, because o'connell.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.00,0:25:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮到谁？轮到我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose play is it? Is it is it my play? I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.24,0:25:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 就这么说定了 晚安 强纳森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, we got us a wager. Good evening, jonathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.67,0:25:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.73,0:26:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我不是故意要吓你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Didn't mean to scare ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.86,0:26:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一会吓到我的 是你的礼貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing that scares me, mr. O'connell, are your manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.96,0:26:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在气我吻你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still angry about that kiss, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.07,0:26:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那哪能算得上吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you call that a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.07,0:26:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不是搞错了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, did I miss something?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.28,0:26:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们…要去打仗吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we are we going into battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.98,0:26:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 那个地方有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady, there's something out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.98,0:26:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙地下面有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something underneath that sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.08,0:26:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望能找到一件古代的文物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well, i'm hoping to find a certain artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.42,0:26:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是一本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}A book, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.46,0:26:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥哥认为那里有宝藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother thinks there's treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.76,0:26:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你认为有什么？- 简单的说 邪门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you think's out there? - In a word? Evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.03,0:26:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝多因人相信哈姆纳塔受到诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bedouin and the tuaregs believe that hamunaptra is cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.67,0:26:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不相信那些老掉牙的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look, I don't believe in fairy tales and hokum, mr. O'connell,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.57,0:26:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我相信那里有一本著名的古书\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do believe one of the most famous books in history is buried there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.87,0:26:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳金经\N{\fnArial\fs30}The book of amun-ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.87,0:27:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,包含了古埃及全部的秘密符咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It contains within it all the secret incantations of the old kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.61,0:27:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这本书让我从小迷上了埃及\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what first interested me in egypt when I was a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.62,0:27:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这里就是为了追求我的梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's why I came here sort of a life's pursuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.12,0:27:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你不在意那本书是不是用黄金打造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the fact that they say it's made out of pure gold makes no never mind to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.39,0:27:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对吧？- 原来你都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right? - You know your history.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.76,0:27:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我关心我的宝藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know my treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.50,0:27:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便问一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um… By the way…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.80,0:27:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么吻我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you kiss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.80,0:27:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都快死了 反正没事做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was about to be hanged. It seemed like a good idea at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.61,0:27:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？我说了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What'd I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.12,0:27:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,太意外了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaah! Aah! Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.12,0:27:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着 谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}My good friend, you're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.09,0:27:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我担心的不得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was so very, very worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.09,0:27:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我的老朋友班尼吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if it ain't my little buddy beni.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.26,0:27:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要宰了你 想想我的小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think i'll kill you. Think of my children.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.50,0:27:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have any children.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.30,0:27:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 将来会有 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Someday I might. - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.67,0:28:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来美国人的领队是你 难怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're the one who's leading the americans. I might have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.20,0:28:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算把他们骗进沙漠 然后丢下他们自生自灭？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's the scam? You take them into the desert, and then you leave 'em to rot?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.57,0:28:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.58,0:28:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些美国人很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}These americans are smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.58,0:28:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们先付一半 另一半回来给\N{\fnArial\fs30}They pay me only half now, half when I get them back to cairo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.92,0:28:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我不能半路开溜 真倒霉 对不对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this time I must go all the way. Them's the breaks, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.35,0:28:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从来都不相信有哈姆纳特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never believed in hamunaptra, o'connell.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.69,0:28:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你要回去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you going back?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.69,0:28:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到那位小姐吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.76,0:28:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她救了我一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}She saved my neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.00,0:28:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一向都是感情用事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always did have more balls than brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.28,0:28:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.78,0:28:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 班尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good-bye, beni.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.55,0:28:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧康诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}O'connell!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.43,0:29:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治班桥…\N{\fnArial\fs30}George bembridge…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.07,0:29:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,在l860年…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In eighteen sixty…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.24,0:29:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,在l865年…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm."1865 was…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.21,0:29:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.21,0:29:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想了 一个吻有什么大不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, for heaven's sake, girl, it wasn't that good of a kiss, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.53,0:29:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,地图在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the map?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.83,0:29:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在 在 那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's…it's… There.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.87,0:29:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙呢？钥匙在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the key? Where is the key?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.27,0:29:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙？什么钥匙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The key? The key? What key?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.08,0:29:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊芙琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evelyn!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.59,0:30:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,地图！我忘了带地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}The map! The map! I forgot the map!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.10,0:30:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 我认得路 全都在我脑子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax. I'm the map. It's all up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.70,0:30:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就放心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's comforting.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.41,0:30:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙 伊芙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The key! Evy?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.13,0:30:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.83,0:31:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会游泳吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you swim?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.60,0:31:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有必要的话 当然会游\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I can swim, if the occasion calls for it. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.23,0:31:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有必要 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It calls for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.69,0:31:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧康诺！欧康诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}O'connell! O'connell!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.56,0:31:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.83,0:31:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在这里等 我去求救 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait here! I'll go get help! - Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.69,0:32:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Americans.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.14,0:32:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 好枪法 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say, bloody good show, chaps!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.57,0:32:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有惊惶失措吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And did I panic?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.58,0:32:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think not.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.95,0:32:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,把马匹拉上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.42,0:32:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它们拉上去！来啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get 'em out of the water! Come on, dogies!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.46,0:32:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮下忙 行不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give 'em a smack, would ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.17,0:32:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一塌糊涂的国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a messed-up country.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.60,0:33:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们什么都没了 所有的工具 设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've lost everything! All of our tools, all the equipment!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.61,0:33:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我全部的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}All my clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.31,0:33:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧康诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}O'connell!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.48,0:33:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 欧康诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! O'connell!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.25,0:33:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,看样子 马匹都在我这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks to me like i've got all the horses!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.62,0:33:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 班尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, beni!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.39,0:33:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,看样子 你上错岸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks to me like you're on the wrong side of the river!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.49,0:33:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.14,0:33:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只要四匹 四匹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only want four! Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.51,0:33:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要的是四匹 不是一群\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only want four, not a whole bloody herd!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.35,0:33:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪！你能相信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}O'connell! Ohh! Can you believe the cheek?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.39,0:33:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你付钱行不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just pay the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.32,0:33:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, for heaven's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.32,0:33:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,几匹臭骆驼还要这么贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't believe the price of these fleabags.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.96,0:34:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,开心啦！非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, happy. Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.63,0:34:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要把你妹给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You probably could've got 'em for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.57,0:34:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不用付钱了 对啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you had to do was give him your sister. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.00,0:34:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是很吸引人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awfully tempting, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.98,0:34:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.07,0:34:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢骆驼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never did like camels.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.07,0:34:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们又脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Filthy buggers.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.01,0:34:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,又臭还会咬人 流口水\N{\fnArial\fs30}They smell, they bite, they spit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.98,0:34:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,讨厌死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.25,0:34:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为它们很可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they're adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.25,0:34:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.72,0:36:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙很强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one is strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.87,0:36:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.22,0:37:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这边干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell we doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.19,0:37:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,耐心点 我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patience, my good barat'm. Patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.86,0:37:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得我们打的赌吗？谁先进城谁赢五百块\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember our bet, o'connell. First one to the city, 500 cash bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.80,0:37:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮我们赢了就给你一百块\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hundred of them bucks is yours if you help us win that bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.30,0:37:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐意效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.90,0:37:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 欧康诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, o'connell.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.84,0:37:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,骆驼不错嘛！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice camel.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.71,0:37:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ready for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.21,0:37:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.21,0:37:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,目的地就快要出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're about to be shown the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.60,0:37:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们快看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will ya look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.43,0:37:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能相信吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.40,0:37:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈姆纳塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hamunaptra.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.03,0:38:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.07,0:38:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 班尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}So long, beni!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.88,0:38:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你活该\N{\fnArial\fs30}That serves you right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.78,0:38:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾 驾 驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teek-teek-teek-teek! Hut-hut-hut!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.92,0:38:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾 驾 驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teek-teek-teek!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.89,0:38:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾 驾 驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teek-teek-teek-teek!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.60,0:39:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 伊芙 加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo-hoo! Go, evy! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.38,0:39:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是不是有事瞒著我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do they know somethin' we don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.68,0:39:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们听女人的指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are led by a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.68,0:39:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人懂什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does a woman know?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.45,0:39:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是死神像\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a statue of anubis.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.99,0:40:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,死神的腿深入地下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its legs go deep underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.99,0:40:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,据考古学家说神像腿部有秘密隔间\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to bembridge scholars, that's where we'll find a secret compartment…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.66,0:40:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,收藏着太阳金经\N{\fnArial\fs30}Containing the golden book of amun-ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.66,0:40:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,强纳森 你一是要对着阳光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jonathan, you're meant to catch the sun with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.14,0:40:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些旧镜子有什么用？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, what are these old mirrors for?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.64,0:40:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是古镜 古埃及的把戏等一下你就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ancient mirrors. It's an ancient egyptian trick. You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.38,0:40:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着 是给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, here, this for, uh, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.18,0:40:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开看 是我向我的美国朋友借的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. It's something I borrowed off our american brethren.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.82,0:40:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你可能会喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you might like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.82,0:40:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该用得到 就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might need it for when you're, uh uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.99,0:40:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,看什么看？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you lookin' at?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.00,0:40:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看有没有虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Look for bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.01,0:40:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最讨厌虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.01,0:40:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能想像我们是三千年来的第一批访客\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're standing inside a room no one has entered in over 3, 000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.04,0:41:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么味道这么臭？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo! What is that god awful stench?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.06,0:41:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后光线…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then there was…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.06,0:41:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,折射进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.10,0:41:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 很特别的把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, that is a neat trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.60,0:41:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 是防腐间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god. It's a sah-netjer. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.27,0:41:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一间准备室 准备什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A preparation room. Preparation for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.47,0:41:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备进入来世\N{\fnArial\fs30}For entering the afterlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.81,0:41:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他们制作木乃伊的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mummies, my good son. This is where they made the mummies.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.92,0:41:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么声音？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.83,0:41:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.30,0:41:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来像…虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like… Bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.57,0:41:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说是虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.57,0:41:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么虫？我最讨厌虫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, bugs? I hate bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.12,0:42:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,死神的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The legs of anubis.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.96,0:42:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,秘密隔间应该就在底部的某个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}The secret compartment should be hidden somewhere inside here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.95,0:42:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点被你们吓死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You scared the bejesus out of us, o'connell.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.62,0:42:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼此彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Likewise.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.92,0:42:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是我的工具 - 我不认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, that's my tool kit. - I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.79,0:42:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,算…了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.86,0:42:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概是我看错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps I was mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.53,0:42:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪了 各位 我们还有很多工作要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a nice day, gentlemen. We have a lot of work to be getting along with.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.20,0:43:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 滚开 这是我们的地盘 - 是我们先到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Push off. This is our dig site. - We got here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.74,0:43:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 这是我们的雕像\N{\fnArial\fs30}This here's our statue, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.14,0:43:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么上面没刻你的名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see your name written on it… Pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.08,0:43:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 你们只有四个人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well, there's only four of you…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.32,0:43:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有十五个\N{\fnArial\fs30}and 15 of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.25,0:43:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的胜算不大 欧康诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your odds are not so great, o'connell.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.65,0:43:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,少来唬我 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had worse. Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.66,0:43:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 小朋友 大家不要吵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look, for goodness' sake, let's be nice, children.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.90,0:43:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果大家要一起玩 就要学会分享\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're going to play together, we must learn to share.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.40,0:43:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有别的地方可以挖\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are other places to dig.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.14,0:43:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据这些象形文字\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to these hieroglyphics,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.88,0:43:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是在雕像下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're underneath the statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.88,0:43:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该从他双腿之间挖上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should come up right between his legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.21,0:43:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,等那些死老美睡了以后 别介意 无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}When those damn yanks go to sleep no offense none taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.55,0:43:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再往上挖 偷走那本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll dig our way up and steal that book right out from under them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.98,0:43:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定我们找得到？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure we can find this secret compartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.41,0:43:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要没有被那些死美国人先找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, if those beastly americans haven't beaten us to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.52,0:43:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别介意 - 无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No offense. - None taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.45,0:44:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的小胖子去哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd our smelly little friend get to?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.74,0:44:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.55,0:44:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.41,0:44:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝色的金子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blue gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.43,0:44:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以卖到一大笔钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will fetch a mighty fine price.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.56,0:44:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们动手吧！小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get us some treasure! Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.98,0:44:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,法老塞提不是笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seti was no fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.75,0:44:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得应该…让工人来橇开它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think perhaps we should let the diggers open it, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.25,0:44:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士说的很有道理 韩德森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I think we should listen to the good doctor, henderson.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.32,0:45:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊就让他们来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure. Let them open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.10,0:45:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说他们把内脏扯出来装进瓮里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They ripped out your guts and stuffed them in jars.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.12,0:45:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你的心脏 你知道他们怎么拿脑子吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd take out your heart as well. You know how they took out your brains?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.85,0:45:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think we need to know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.86,0:45:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,把一枝烧得通红的火钳插进你的鼻孔…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd take a sharp, red-hot poker, stick it up your nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.89,0:45:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,把脑浆稍微搅烂 然后用力拉出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scramble things about a bit and then rip it all out through your nostrils.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.96,0:45:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定很痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's gotta hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.96,0:45:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 那时候你已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called mummification. You'll be dead when they do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.30,0:45:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,先说好 我就算出不去都不当木乃伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't make it out of here, don't put me down for mummifiication.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.16,0:45:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Likewise.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.81,0:46:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god. It's a…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.55,0:46:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是具石棺\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a sarcophagus.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.02,0:46:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,埋在死神的脚底下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buried at the base of anubis.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.19,0:46:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他如果不是身世显赫\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have been someone of great importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.20,0:46:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是…犯了滔天大罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or he did something very naughty.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.87,0:46:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, allah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.77,0:46:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,再一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.11,0:46:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,再一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.30,0:46:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！快救我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.97,0:46:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.04,0:47:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.89,0:47:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不配留下姓名\N{\fnArial\fs30}"He that shall not be named."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.26,0:47:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来好像是锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}This looks like some sort of a lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.13,0:47:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是谁都别想出来 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, whoever's in here sure wasn't getting out. Yeah, no kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.57,0:47:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有钥匙 要一个月才撬得开\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd take us a month to crack into this thing without a key.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.07,0:47:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A key?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.07,0:47:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙 钥匙 原来那个人说的就是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}A key! A key! That's what he was talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.08,0:47:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁？- 船上的铁钩人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who? - The man on the barge.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.20,0:47:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在找一条钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one with the hook. He was looking for a key.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.02,0:47:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 那是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, that's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.84,0:48:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想他为什么会死？因为暴饮暴食\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you suppose killed him? Did you ever see him eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.08,0:48:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来美国人今天的运气也不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems that our american friends had a little misfortune of their own today.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.05,0:48:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有三名挖掘工人…溶化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three of their diggers were, uh… Melted.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.75,0:48:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？怎么溶化？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.82,0:48:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,盐酸 高压盐酸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salt acid. Pressurized salt acid.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.73,0:48:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,中了某种古老的陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of ancient booby trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.00,0:48:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能真的有诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this place really is cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.94,0:48:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, for goodness' sake, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.77,0:48:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不相信诅咒？不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't believe in curses? No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.90,0:48:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只相信碰得到看得到的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe if I can see it and I can touch it, it's real. That's what I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.04,0:48:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信有备无患\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe in being prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.35,0:48:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们的典狱长相信什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what our friend the warden believed in.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.92,0:48:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aaah! - My god, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.66,0:48:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一支破瓶子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A broken bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.66,0:49:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,十二年的威士忌酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenlivet. Twelve years old!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.53,0:49:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他人不怎么样 品味倒不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}He may have been a stinky fellow, but he had good taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.50,0:49:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着 别乱跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this. Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.21,0:49:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 等等我… 伊芙\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait, wait! Wait for me. Wait! Evy!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.07,0:49:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他明明叫你不要乱跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, but didn't the man just say "stay here"? Evy!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.25,0:49:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩德森先生 快起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Henderson! Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.29,0:50:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧康诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hyah! O'connell!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.08,0:50:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough! Y allah!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.18,0:50:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不杀你们 但是你们必须走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will shed no more blood, but you must leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.42,0:50:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不走就死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave this place or die.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.62,0:50:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有一天的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.26,0:50:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yallah! Nimshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.05,0:51:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊芙琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evelyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.59,0:51:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.62,0:51:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right? Yes, i'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.96,0:51:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定？- 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You sure? - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.96,0:51:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道塞提的宝藏一定在地底下\N{\fnArial\fs30}That proves it. Old seti's fortune's got to be under this sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.13,0:51:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则他们没有必要袭击我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}For them to protect it like this, you know there's treasure down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.54,0:51:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这些是沙漠民族 水对他们比黄金珍贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, these men are desert people. They value water, not gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.37,0:51:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 或许在晚上我们可以合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, maybe just at night, we could, uh, combine forces, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.58,0:51:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,很厉害 试试看右钩拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, tough stuff, try a right hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.88,0:51:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,把拳头提高 像这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ball up your fist and put it put it up like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.48,0:51:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后用力 打这只手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm. And then mean it. Hit it right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.41,0:51:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用力 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it! Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.79,0:51:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, it's time for another drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.66,0:51:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 不像我哥…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unlike my brother, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.80,0:51:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道适可而止\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know when to say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.40,0:51:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 你不像你哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh. And unlike your brother, miss,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.74,0:51:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是搞不懂你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, I just don't get.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.81,0:52:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 你一定奇怪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. I know. You're wondering…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.68,0:52:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我这样的人怎么会来这种地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is a place like me doing in a girl like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.88,0:52:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多 这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.37,0:52:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我天生喜欢埃及\N{\fnArial\fs30}Egypt is in my blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.52,0:52:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道…我父亲是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, my my… father…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.19,0:52:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位非常 非常有名的探险家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was a very, very famous explorer,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.96,0:52:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他热爱埃及…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he loved egypt so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.36,0:52:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以娶了我母亲 她是埃及人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He married my mother, who was an egyptian…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.87,0:52:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且也是位探险家\N{\fnArial\fs30}And quite an adventurer herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.80,0:52:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白你的父母…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. I get your father, and I get your mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.11,0:52:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.54,0:52:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也明白他 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get him, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.78,0:52:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这里干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.78,0:52:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听着 我或许不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, i may not be…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.75,0:52:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,探险家\N{\fnArial\fs30}An explorer…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.75,0:52:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是冒…险家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or-or an adventurer…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.29,0:52:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是寻宝家 更不是枪手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a treasure seeker or a gunfighter,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.49,0:52:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧康诺先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. O'connell,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.50,0:52:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我以我的职业为荣\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am proud of what I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.40,0:53:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.10,0:53:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.34,0:53:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是图书馆管理员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am a librarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.44,0:53:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我要吻你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am going to kiss you,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.98,0:53:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧康诺先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. O'connell.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.62,0:53:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.22,0:53:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.49,0:54:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,箱子上面有诅咒 诅咒个屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a curse upon this chest. Curse, my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.19,0:54:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会在意？韩德森先生 你应该在意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares? Have a care, mr. Henderson.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.10,0:54:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这种地方 古代下的诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}In these hallowed grounds, that which was set forth in ancient times…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.27,0:54:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,仍旧非常灵验 明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is as strong today as it was then. We understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.03,0:54:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面写什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.95,0:54:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡开此箱者…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Death will come on swift wings…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.62,0:54:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,必难逃杀身之祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}To whomsoever opens this chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.93,0:54:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不该来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should not be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.20,0:54:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况不太妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.20,0:54:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面还写着 此箱一开…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says, there is one.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.54,0:54:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,原为圣律所封闭的怨灵…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The undead Who, if brought back to life, is bound by sacred law…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.03,0:54:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,将破解诅咒 重返人间\N{\fnArial\fs30}To consummate this curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.78,0:54:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就确定不要救活任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's make sure we don't bring anyone back from the dead then.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.72,0:54:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将杀尽所有开箱之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}"He will kill all who open this chest…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.12,0:55:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,取其五脏六腑及血液\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And assimilate their organs and fluids,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.32,0:55:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,藉此法而复生…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And in so doing, he will regenerate…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.19,0:55:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,由受诅咒之怨灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no longer be the undead.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.10,0:55:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,化为祸害人间之妖孽\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a plague upon this earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.37,0:55:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们大老远跑来 总算有收获\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we didn't come all this way for nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.64,0:55:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 是诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. It's the curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.64,0:55:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.91,0:55:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是诅咒！小心诅咒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the curse! Beware of the curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.14,0:55:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beware!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.28,0:55:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,迷信的死白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid superstitious bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.55,0:55:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从小就梦想着这一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, i've dreamt about this since I was a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.95,0:55:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的梦想是死尸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You dream about dead guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.96,0:55:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看 他的圣律被凿掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, his sacred spells have been chiseled off.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.96,0:55:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人不只这辈子而且下辈子都受到诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}This man must have been condemned not only in this life but in the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.13,0:55:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不幸 是的 赚人热泪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tough break. Yeah, i'm all tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.80,0:55:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在…来看看里面是谁如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let's see who's inside, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.58,0:56:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊我最讨厌他们这个样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god, I hate it when these things do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.31,0:56:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的样子正常吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he supposed to look like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.32,0:56:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 我从来没看过这样的木乃伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, i've never seen a mummy look like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.09,0:56:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是…还是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still… still…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.42,0:56:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很新鲜 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Juicy. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.59,0:56:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了应该超过三千年了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must be more than 3, 000 years old,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.83,0:56:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是看起来好像还没有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, well, it looks as if he's still…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.33,0:56:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全腐化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decomposing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.93,0:56:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.10,0:56:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这你怎么解释？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you make of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.54,0:56:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 这些痕迹是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My god, these marks were made with…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.61,0:56:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,指甲划的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fingernails.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.11,0:56:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人是活着被关进去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This man was buried alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.48,0:56:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还留了一句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he left a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.02,0:56:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡只是开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death is only the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.44,0:57:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.74,0:57:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,它真的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.48,0:57:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是亡灵黑经 一本书？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The book of the dead. A book?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.25,0:57:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,管他什么书？宝藏在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares about a book? Where the hell's the treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.98,0:57:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 这本书…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.75,0:57:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是无价之宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.52,0:57:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,少来了 你送给我我都不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I wouldn't trade you for a brass…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.83,0:57:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.00,0:57:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是你们的宝藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's your treasure, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.37,0:57:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于有点收获\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we're onto something.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.29,0:57:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要有钥匙才能打开那本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you need a key to open that book.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.32,0:57:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想这些宝贝回去能卖多少钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say, o'connell, what do you think these babies'll fetch back home?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.93,0:57:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说你们找到新鲜的木乃伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hear you boys found yourselves a nice, gooey mummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.66,0:57:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.40,0:58:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他晒干了 还可以当柴火卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you dry that fella out, you might be able to sell him for firewood.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.47,0:58:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我找到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}look what I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.97,0:58:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你坐了她的位子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in her seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.97,0:58:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 起来 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now! - Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.08,0:58:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣甲虫的骸骨 是种食肉虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scarab skeletons, flesh eaters.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.71,0:58:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在他的棺材里找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found them inside our friend's coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.31,0:58:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种虫有尸体吃 可以活好几年\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can stay alive for years feasting on the flesh of a corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.13,0:58:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可怜的朋友被吃的时候还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately for our friend, he was still alive when they started eating him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.46,0:58:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以有人丢这些虫进去让他慢慢被吃掉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So somebody threw these in with our guy, and then they slowly ate him alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.79,0:58:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常的慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.80,0:58:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定是不受欢迎才会被设计\N{\fnArial\fs30}He certainly wasn't a popular fellow when they planted him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.70,0:58:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,八成和法老的女儿走得太近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he probably got a little too frisky with the pharaoh's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.07,0:58:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我所知…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, according to my readings,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.44,0:58:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种刑罚叫「虫噬」 是古埃及最恶毒的诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our friend suffered the hom-dai, the worst of all ancient egyptian curses.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.62,0:58:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,用来对付十恶不赦的罪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}One reserved only for the most evil of blasphemers.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.01,0:58:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没听过这项诅咒被执行过\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my research, i've never heard of this curse having actually been performed.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.18,0:58:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么厉害？对 他们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That bad, huh? Yes, well, they…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.85,0:58:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不执行是因为担心后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never used it because they feared it so.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.79,0:58:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,书上说「虫噬」的罪人一旦复生…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's written that if a victim of the hom-dai should ever arise.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.29,0:59:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,会带来埃及的十大灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would bring with him the ten plagues of egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.26,0:59:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 这叫偷窃\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's called stealing, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.60,0:59:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,照你和我哥的说法…\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to you and my brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.66,0:59:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这叫借\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called borrowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.71,0:59:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为太阳金经是金的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the book of amun-ra was made out of gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.00,0:59:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳金经的确是金的 这本不是太阳金经\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is made out of gold. This isn't the book of amun-ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.11,0:59:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是另外一本\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.34,0:59:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想应该是亡灵黑经\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this may be the book of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.58,0:59:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,亡灵黑经？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The book of the dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.58,0:59:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你还拿这本书来玩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you want to be playing around with this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.59,1:00:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一本书 而且读书…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a book. No harm ever came from…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.56,1:00:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有坏处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reading a book.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.20,1:00:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事常发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That happens a lot around here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.67,1:00:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面写什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's it say?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.67,1:00:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳 太阴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amun ra. Amun dei.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.54,1:00:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是白天和夜晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It speaks of the night and of the day.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.39,1:00:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.70,1:00:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可以念出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must not read from the book!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.79,1:01:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.52,1:01:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 动作快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.63,1:01:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have we done?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.30,1:01:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝗虫是从哪来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell did they come from?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.64,1:01:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道就自己去查\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't waitin' around to find out.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.51,1:01:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的眼镜 我的眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}My glasses. My glasses!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.18,1:01:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开 走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me! Leave me!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.65,1:01:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.09,1:01:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你帮我找我的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you help me find my gl… oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.09,1:01:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.85,1:02:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.38,1:02:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在那里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.53,1:02:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩德森？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henderson?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.16,1:02:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, jon!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.90,1:03:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣甲虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scarabs!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.90,1:03:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊芙 快跑 - 快走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Run, evy! - Go, go, go! Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.34,1:03:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊芙琳？- 伊芙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Evelyn? - Evy?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.17,1:03:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊芙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evelyn! Evy!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.86,1:03:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩斯先生 谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Oh, mr. Burns. Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.86,1:04:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在开始害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just starting to get scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.43,1:04:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找不到他们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lost everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.66,1:04:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的眼睛 我的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}My eyes. My eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.49,1:04:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.91,1:04:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的舌头 他咬掉我的舌头\N{\fnArial\fs30}My tongue. He took my tongue.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.88,1:04:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 不要丢下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't leave me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.83,1:04:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,安苏娜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anck-su-namun?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.03,1:04:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！是扇活门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it! It's a trap door.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.17,1:04:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,开关一定就在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be a switch or something around here someplace.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.31,1:04:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃啊王八蛋 还不逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run, you sons of bitches! Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.41,1:04:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.56,1:05:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.00,1:05:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我的安苏娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me my princess Anck-su-namun.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.87,1:05:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到你了 玩什么捉迷藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are! Will you quit playing hide-and-seek?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.11,1:05:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's get out of here. Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.88,1:05:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊芙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evy!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.61,1:05:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 当然 看到没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Move! - Yeah, right. Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.73,1:05:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是活的 是活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was walking. It was walking!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.50,1:05:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过你们不走就死 你们不听\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you to leave or die. You refused.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.68,1:05:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在大家都得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you may have killed us all,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.91,1:06:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们释放了一头三千年的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you have unleashed a creature we have feared for more than 3, 000 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.28,1:06:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放心 我杀了他 - 人类的武器杀不死他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Relax. I got him. - No mortal weapon can kill this creature.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.82,1:06:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不属于这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not of this world.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.09,1:06:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 混蛋 - 你们把他怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You bastard. - What did you do to him?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.81,1:06:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从怪物手中把他救了回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We saved him, saved him before the creature could finish his work.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.90,1:06:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要是不想死就马上离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave, all of you, quickly, before he finishes you all.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.80,1:06:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y allah. Nimishi.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.77,1:06:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须进去 想办法解决他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must now go on the hunt and try and find a way to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.56,1:06:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过 他被我杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already told you I got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.95,1:06:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.95,1:06:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个怪物是死亡的使者\N{\fnArial\fs30}This creature is the bringer of death.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.69,1:06:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会饿 他不会累\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will never eat, he will never sleep…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.56,1:06:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他更不会停\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.96,1:07:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿上帝保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the good lord protect and watch over me…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.80,1:07:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,像牧者保护羊群一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a shepherd watches over his flock.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.81,1:07:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.47,1:08:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,奴隶的语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}The language of the slaves…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.34,1:08:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能用得到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may have use for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.04,1:08:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你侍奉我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the rewards…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.91,1:08:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,大大有赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}…will be great.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.25,1:08:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,请殿下吩咐\N{\fnArial\fs30}My prince.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.14,1:08:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他的圣瓮在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are the other sacred jars?!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.33,1:08:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾 驾 驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teek-teek-teek-teek. Hut-hut-hut!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.34,1:08:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,开罗拜顿堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fort brydon cai ro.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.08,1:08:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是不相信老掉牙的故事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said you didn't believe in that fairy tales and hokum stuff. Shoo!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.42,1:08:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,遇到了会走路 会说话的三千年木乃伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having an encounter with a 3, 000-year-old walking, talking corpse…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.63,1:08:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我不得不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does tend to convert one.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.88,1:09:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想 立刻收拾 我们退房走人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it. We're out the door, down the hall and we're gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.11,1:09:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们不走 是 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, we are not. Oh, yes, we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.63,1:09:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不走 我们有责任阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, we are not. We woke him up, and we are going to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.05,1:09:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么我们？我又没看那本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We"? What we? We didn't read that book.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.46,1:09:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有没有叫你不要碰那本书？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you not to play around with that thing. Didn't I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.96,1:09:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是我 是我 所以我有责任阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, then me, me, me, me, i, i, I woke him up and I intend to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.15,1:09:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么阻止？那家伙说了寻常武器杀不死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? How? You heard the man… No mortal weapons can kill this guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.20,1:09:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就要找不寻常的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we are just going to have to find some immortal ones.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.32,1:09:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是我们 听我说好吗？我们不能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There goes that "we" again. Will you listen to me? We have to do…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.32,1:09:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个怪物一旦复生…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaah! Once this creature has been reborn,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.42,1:09:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的诅咒会祸害人间\N{\fnArial\fs30}His curse is going to spread until the whole of the earth is destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.21,1:09:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那关我什么事？这关所有人的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Is that my problem? It is everybody's problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.86,1:09:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊芙琳 你救了我 我很感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evelyn, I appreciate you saving my life and all, but when I signed on,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.72,1:09:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是当初我只答应带你过去和带你回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agreed to take you out there and to bring you back.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.19,1:09:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经交了差 履行了合约 没什么好说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have done that. End of job. End of story.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.11,1:09:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你而言就只是一张合约？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Contract terminated. That's all I am to you? A contract?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.82,1:09:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要么就跟我走…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can either tag along with me…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.89,1:09:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么就自己留下来拯救全世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you can stay here… And try and save the world!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.18,1:09:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎样？- 我留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's it gonna be? - I'm staying.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.18,1:09:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine! Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.18,1:09:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 - 随你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fine. - Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.35,1:10:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 随你 - 哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fine. - Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.24,1:10:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我是驻扎在本地的最后一名皇家空军\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the last of the royal air corps still stationed out here, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.86,1:10:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个白痴的酒洒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some bloody idiot spilled his drink.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.23,1:10:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的袍泽都战死空中长埋沙下\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the other laddies died in the sky and were buried in the sand.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.14,1:10:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们个个都是好汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good chaps, every one of them too. Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.07,1:10:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 温斯顿 欧康诺 你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, winston. Ye… uh… you know, o'connell.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.13,1:10:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从大战结束以后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever since the end of the great war,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.93,1:10:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就变成…英雄无用武之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}There hasn't been a single challenge…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.72,1:10:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？我们都有烦恼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worthy of a man like me. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.25,1:10:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恨我不能像其他战友一样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all got our little problems today, winston.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.59,1:10:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是希望我能够打发与他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wish I could have chucked it in with the others…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.94,1:10:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,轰轰烈烈的光荣殉职\N{\fnArial\fs30}And gone down in flame and glory,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.76,1:10:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能无聊的坐在这边喝闷酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead of sitting around here, Rotting of boredom and booze.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.03,1:10:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheers. Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.73,1:10:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,该回机场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm. Oh, well, back to the airfield.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.21,1:10:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你妹妹一向这么… - 是的 一向\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell me, has your sister always been… - Oh, yes, always.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.21,1:10:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那艘该死的船明天才能出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all packed up, but the damn boat doesn't leave till tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.21,1:11:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备挟着尾巴逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tail set firmly between your legs, I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.13,1:11:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得轻松 被追杀的又不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can talk. You don't have some sacred walkin' corpse after ya.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.08,1:11:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朋友还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, how's your friend?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.05,1:11:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼睛和舌头都被人挖掉 你说会好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had his eyes and his tongue ripped out. How would you be?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.66,1:11:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常高兴…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so pleased…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.80,1:11:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}To meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.80,1:11:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莫顿殿下不喜欢人家碰他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prince imhotep does not like to be touched.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.70,1:11:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是东方的忌讳迷信\N{\fnArial\fs30}A silly eastern superstition, i'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.34,1:11:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,请不要见怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.37,1:11:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh-ho. Ohh. Whoops.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.24,1:11:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Burns,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.25,1:11:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,殿下谢谢你的热情招待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prince imhotep thanks you for your hospitality.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.55,1:11:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.65,1:11:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要谢谢你奉献眼睛…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for your eyes…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.42,1:11:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有舌头\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for your tongue. Wha.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.36,1:11:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 你必须继续奉献 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am afraid more is needed. What?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.73,1:11:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,殿下必须继续仪式…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The prince must finish the job…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.73,1:11:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成诅咒你和你的朋友们 不！不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And consummate the curse which you and your friends… No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.75,1:11:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是你们自己招来的报应 - 不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have brought down upon yourselves. - Wait! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.27,1:12:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你们好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.01,1:12:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么？味道像…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetjesus! Tasted just like…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.85,1:12:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.22,1:12:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃及的江河一片殷红…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And the rivers and waters of egypt ran red…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.02,1:12:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如鲜血一般\N{\fnArial\fs30}And were as blood."
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.80,1:12:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他找上门来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.37,1:12:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看样子会有暴风雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, looks like there's gonna be a storm.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.27,1:12:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊芙琳 - 原来你还没走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, evelyn! - Oh, so you're still here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.87,1:12:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got problems.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.76,1:12:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.77,1:13:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个人渣 你躲哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beni, you little stinkweed. Where you been?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.29,1:13:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们麻烦大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are in serious trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.65,1:13:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你释放了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved me from the undead.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.22,1:13:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.93,1:14:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真的麻烦大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are in very serious trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.70,1:14:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好像喜欢伊芙\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does seem to like evy.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.71,1:14:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what's that about?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.71,1:14:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到底想干嘛？只有一个人能回答我们的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this guy want? There's only one person that can give us any answers.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.40,1:14:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你 - 卡纳汉小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You! - Miss carnahan.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.28,1:14:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 男士们 - 他在这里干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gentlemen. - What is he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.08,1:14:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的想知道还是想一枪打死我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really want to know, or would you prefer to just shoot us?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.89,1:14:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过了刚才的事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}After what I just saw,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.06,1:14:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意对你有点信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm willing to go on a little faith here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.79,1:14:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们属于一个古老的秘密组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are part of an ancient secret society.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.05,1:14:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,三千年来我们看守着亡灵之城\N{\fnArial\fs30}For over 3, 000 years we have guarded the city of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.23,1:14:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们立过誓会竭尽所能… 阻止大祭司伊莫顿重返人问\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are sworn at manhood to do any and all in our part to stop the high priest imhotep…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.07,1:14:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你们 我们失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}From being reborn into this world. Because of you, we have failed.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.84,1:14:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这样就有藉口滥杀无辜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this justifies the killing of innocent people?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.48,1:14:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了阻止这个怪物？让我想想 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}To stop this creature? Let me think. Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.42,1:14:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题 他为什么怕猫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Question: why doesn't he like cats?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.32,1:15:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,猫是地府的守护者 也是他完全复生之前的克星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cats are the guardians of the underworld. He will fear them until he is fully regenerated.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.19,1:15:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 之后就什么都不怕了 - 你知道他怎么复生吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then he will fear nothing. - You know how he gets hisself fully regenerated?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.49,1:15:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是杀死所有开箱的人 而且吸干他们的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}By killin' everyone who opened that chest. And suckin' 'em dry!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.53,1:15:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,强纳森 别再玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jonathan, will you stop playing with that?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.76,1:15:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哈姆纳塔看到他的时候 他叫我安苏娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I saw him alive at hamunaptra, he called me Anck-su-namun.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.47,1:15:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才在旅馆的时候他还想亲我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then just now in mr. Burns' quarters, he tried to kiss me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.04,1:15:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被诅咒就是因为爱上安苏娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's because of his love for Anck-su-namun that he was cursed.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.56,1:15:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然经过了三千年… 他还是爱着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, even after 3, 000 years… he is still in love with her.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.05,1:15:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,很浪漫 但是关我什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, that is very romantic, but what has it got to do with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.23,1:15:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会试着再次为她招魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps he will once again try to raise her from the dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.19,1:15:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来他已经选中了他的祭品\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it appears he has already chosen his human sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.33,1:15:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真倒霉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad luck, old mum.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.30,1:15:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,相反的… 这正好给我们足够的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the contrary, it mayjust give us the time we need…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.73,1:15:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,来消灭他\N{\fnArial\fs30}To kill the creature.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.73,1:15:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要所有的帮助 他的力量在增强\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will need all the help we can get. His powers are growing.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.81,1:16:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他向天伸出他的手…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he stretched forth his hand towards the heavens…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.58,1:16:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃及便笼罩在漆黑之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there was darkness throughout the land of egypt.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.42,1:16:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定要阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must stop him from regenerating.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.92,1:16:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开箱子的有谁？有我和丹尼…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who opened that chest? There was me and daniels here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.07,1:16:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然有伯恩斯 还有那个埃及学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}And burns, of course. And that egyptologist fellow.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.61,1:16:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我朋友班尼呢？- 没有 我们打开之前他就溜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about my buddy beni? - No, he scrammed outta there before we opened the thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.73,1:16:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 他比较聪明 - 没错 他的一贯作风\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, he was the smart one. - Well, that sounds like beni.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.73,1:16:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要尽快找到埃及学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must find the egyptologist and bring him back to the safety of the fort…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.25,1:16:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在怪物找到他之前带他回来 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before the creature can get to him. Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.25,1:16:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她留下来 你们三个跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}She stays here. You three, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.93,1:16:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去 你凭什么不让我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't leave me behind like some old carpetbag.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.26,1:16:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我干嘛要听你的？你以为你在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who put you in charge? O'connell, what do you think you are doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.55,1:16:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,强纳森！欧康诺 对不起 他块头比我…大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jonathan! O'connell! Sorry, but he's a bit… Tall.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.27,1:16:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧康诺 你这个孬种你不能把我留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coward that you are! O'connell, you are not leaving me in here!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.72,1:16:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,强纳森你要是不马上把门打开…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jonathan, if you don't open this door in one minute flat…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.06,1:16:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准开门 不准任何人进出 知不知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}O'connell, let me out ofhere. This door doesn't open.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.23,1:16:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't come out, and no one goes in, right? Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.07,1:16:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道？- 知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right? - Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.43,1:16:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧康诺！强纳森 强纳森 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}O'connell! Jonathan! Let's go, jonathan.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.97,1:17:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我可以留下来…监视\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I thought I could just stay at the fort and, uh, reconnoiter.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.14,1:17:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上 对 我们只是要去救埃及学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now! Yeah, right. We're just gonna rescue the egyptologist.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.74,1:17:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,来看看 让我猜 春季大扫除\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, well. Let me guess. Spring cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.75,1:17:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.60,1:17:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,班尼 跌倒啦 让我来扶你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, beni, did you fall down? Let me help you up.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.46,1:17:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在沙漠认识了一位新朋友对不对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came back from the desert with a new friend, didn't you, beni?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.55,1:17:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么朋友？你是我唯一的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}What friend? You are my only friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.97,1:18:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛和他混在一起 对你有什么好处？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing with this creep? What's in it for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.81,1:18:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮他做事总比跟他作对好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is better to be the right hand of the devil than in his path.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.98,1:18:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我服侍他 我就不会有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as I serve him, I am immune.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.82,1:18:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Immune from what? Piszkas allat.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.07,1:18:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外语]
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.85,1:18:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？我不要告诉你 你只会欺负我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say? I don't wanna tell you. You'll just hurt me some more.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.51,1:18:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在找什么？最好不要骗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you looking for? And try not to lie to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.46,1:18:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那本书 在哈姆纳塔找到的那本书 他要拿回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The book! The black book they found at hamunaptra. He wants it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.53,1:18:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说那本书比黄金还珍贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said to me it would be worth its weight in gold.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.55,1:18:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他要那本书干嘛？- 我真的不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What does he want the book for? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.70,1:18:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,和救活他的死女朋友有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something about bringing his dead girlfriend back to life.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.41,1:18:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样 他只要那本书 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's all.he just wants the book, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.73,1:18:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有那本书 我发誓 还有你妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the book, I swear. And your sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.51,1:18:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了那些以外…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But other than that…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.23,1:19:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,挂了两个 还剩两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's two down, two to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.60,1:19:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他就会去找伊芙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he'll be coming after evy.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.97,1:19:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,警戒布署完毕 报告 一切正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guards in place! Reporting all clear, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.21,1:19:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,管他去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}To hell with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.49,1:19:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到楼下喝杯酒 你要什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm goin' downstairs, get me a drink. You want somethin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.03,1:19:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要一杯威士忌加冰 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Yeah, get me a glass of bourbon. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.21,1:19:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还要杯纯威士忌 - 好 知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A and a shot of bourbon. - Yeah, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.78,1:19:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要配酒的饮料 反正你要波本就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a bourbon chaser. I'll get your damn bourbon!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.83,1:20:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,连门都不关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.42,1:21:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,安苏娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anck-su-namun.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.17,1:21:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 丑八怪 不要碰她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, get your ugly face off ofher!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.77,1:22:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我拿的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what I got.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.19,1:22:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？嗯 我不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right? Well, i'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.90,1:22:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据传说… 在哈姆纳塔找到的那本黑经\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, according to legend, the black book the americans found at hamunaptra…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.08,1:22:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该可以让死人复活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is supposed to bring people back from the dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.59,1:22:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前一直都不愿意相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until now it was a notion I was unwilling to believe. Believe it, sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.70,1:22:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信吧！那家伙不就复活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what brought our buddy back to life.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.23,1:22:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想 如果黑经可以让死人复活…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking that if the black book can bring dead people to life…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.74,1:22:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那金经就应该可以杀死他 没有人知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then maybe the gold book can kill him. That's the myth.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.26,1:22:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们必须把金经找出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we just have to find out where the gold book is hidden.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.58,1:22:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莫顿 伊莫顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imhotep. Imhotep.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.93,1:23:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莫顿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imhotep.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.14,1:23:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莫顿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imhotep.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.95,1:23:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后的大灾难是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imhotep. Last but not least,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.97,1:23:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最喜欢的疖子和烂疮\N{\fnArial\fs30}My favorite plague… boils and sores.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.45,1:23:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们变成他的奴隶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have become his slaves.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.96,1:23:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,看样子世界末日已经开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it has begun, the beginning of the end.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.29,1:23:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还言之过早 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not quite yet, it hasn't. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.53,1:23:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莫顿 伊莫顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imhotep. Imhotep.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.52,1:23:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据考古学家的研究…\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to bembridge scholars, the golden book of amunra…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.87,1:23:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,死神雕像内藏的是太阳金经\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is located inside the statue of anubis.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.04,1:23:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们找到的却是亡灵黑经 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's where we found the black book. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.41,1:24:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来那些老学究一定搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like the old boys at bembridge were mistaken. They mixed the books up.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.08,1:24:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把两本书的埋藏地点搞混了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mixed up where they were buried.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.88,1:24:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然黑经是藏在死神像内\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if the black book is inside the statue of anubis,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.98,1:24:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那金经一定是藏在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the golden book must be inside…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.58,1:24:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊伊芙 快点 耐心是美德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, evy. Faster. Patience is a virtue.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.98,1:24:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在可不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not right now it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.98,1:24:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看我先去发车好了 我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I think i'll go and get the car started.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.62,1:24:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,金经是藏在哈姆纳特的太阳神像内\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got it. The golden book of amun-ra is at hamunaptra inside the statue of horus.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.56,1:24:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些笨老头子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take that, bembridge scholars.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.89,1:24:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莫顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imhotep.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.17,1:24:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莫顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imhotep.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.94,1:25:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.59,1:25:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 千万别熄火 我们快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get this thing in gear, boy. Let's get outta here. Evy!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.41,1:25:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊芙 快上车 伊莫顿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, evy. Hurry up. Imhotep!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.57,1:25:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会有报应的 班尼 你听到没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna get yours, beni! You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.88,1:25:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会有报应的 - 我又不是第一次听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're gonna get yours! - Oh, like i've never heard that before!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.68,1:25:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐稳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.51,1:26:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧康诺 欧康诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! O'connell! O'connell!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.44,1:27:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay! Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.84,1:27:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后 退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back! Back!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.45,1:27:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莫顿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imhotep. Imhotep.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.56,1:28:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the creature.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.20,1:28:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经完全复生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's fully regenerated.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.80,1:28:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keetah mi pharos.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.00,1:28:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aja nilo isirian.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.91,1:28:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我的公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}"come with me, my princess.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.04,1:28:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,从此 你将永远属于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is time to make you mine forever."
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.95,1:28:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是永恒属于我 白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all eternity, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.95,1:28:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}Koontash dai na.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.49,1:28:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aja nilo.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.49,1:28:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我走…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"take my hand,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.41,1:28:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就放了你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will spare your friends."
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.09,1:28:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.50,1:28:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有想到办法吗？我正在想 正在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you got any bright ideas? I'm thinkin', i'm thinkin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.80,1:28:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好赶快想 如果我被他变成木乃伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better think of something fast, because if he turns me into a mummy,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.22,1:28:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一个找你算帐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the first one i'm coming after.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.91,1:28:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.61,1:28:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 他必须带我到哈姆纳塔举行仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - He has to take me to hamunaptra to perform the ritual.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.53,1:28:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说得对 只有暂时忍气吞声\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is right. Live today, fight tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.83,1:29:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会再见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be seeing you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.67,1:29:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊芙琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evelyn!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.01,1:29:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 那是我的 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, that's mine. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.35,1:29:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them all!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.65,1:29:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.65,1:29:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imhotep. Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.62,1:29:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见了 我的朋友 - 回来 你这个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good-bye, my friend. - Come here, you little…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.29,1:29:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莫顿 伊莫顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imhotep. Imhotep.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.89,1:29:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 下去 - 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Imhotep. - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.86,1:29:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我妹呢？- 我们会救她出来 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about my sister? - We're gonna get her back! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.57,1:29:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,换你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're next!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.30,1:29:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 把手给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Give me your hand!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.51,1:29:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你先走 - 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You go! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.34,1:29:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.44,1:30:07.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（吉萨港皇家空军基地）
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.94,1:30:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,早 温斯顿 有事商量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, winston. Uh, a word?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.78,1:30:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的问题和皇家空军有关系吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your little problem got to do with his majesty's royal air corps?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.92,1:30:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.55,1:30:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 危险吗？- 你很可能会一去不回\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it dangerous? - You probably won't live through it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.46,1:30:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊你是说真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Byjove, do you really think so?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.81,1:30:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们碰到的人都挂了 凭什么你例外？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody else we've bumped into has died. Why not you?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.45,1:30:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么…是什么情况？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the, uh… what's the challenge then?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.53,1:30:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,营救美女 杀死坏蛋拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rescue the damsel in distress, kill the bad guy and save the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.83,1:30:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,温斯顿 在此听侯差遣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Winston havelock at your service, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.48,1:31:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.92,1:31:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这个样子看起来好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I bloody look all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.12,1:31:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.76,1:31:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到没？从来没看过这么大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See that? I've never seen one so big.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.11,1:31:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没有？没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never? No!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.69,1:31:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开 滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off of me! Get off.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.76,1:31:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要换工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a new job.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.45,1:32:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.45,1:32:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're back.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.47,1:32:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧康诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}O'connell.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.75,1:32:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.38,1:32:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,温斯顿 踩油门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, winston! Pedal faster!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.69,1:32:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐稳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, men!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.74,1:33:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 你会杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it! You'll kill them!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.10,1:33:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.27,1:33:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,战友们 我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here I come, laddies!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.88,1:34:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你那招飞沙走石\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love the whole sand wall trick.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.22,1:34:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,很厉害 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was beautiful. Bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.91,1:34:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.58,1:34:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是不麻烦的话帮帮忙行不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, a little help would be useful, If it's not too much trouble!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.31,1:34:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.36,1:35:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,温斯顿…温斯顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winston! Hey, winston!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.84,1:35:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是流沙 快退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quicksand! Get back! It's quicksand.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.43,1:36:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.93,1:36:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你这种卑鄙小人始终都会得到报应的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nasty little fellows such as yourself always get their comeuppance.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.43,1:36:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？报应？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? They do?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.56,1:36:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 迟早的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes. Always.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.48,1:36:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,先搬大块的石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd take those bigger stones first.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.72,1:36:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,先搬上面的 否则会整个塌下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take them from the top, otherwise the whole thing will cave in on us.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.89,1:36:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们搬快一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Put your backs into it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.89,1:36:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没错 就是那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well, you've got the idea. Chop, chop.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.50,1:36:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.87,1:37:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位 你们过来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gents, you should come and have a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.98,1:37:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.41,1:37:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑进我手臂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in my arm! My arm!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.69,1:37:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.32,1:37:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,快想办法 抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do something! Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.29,1:37:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,快想办法…不要用刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do something! Do something! Not that! Not that!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.37,1:37:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧康诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}O'connell.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.21,1:37:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shatay wapay ku ra eck!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.67,1:38:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,班桥学院的研究从来没提过这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bembridge scholars never wrote about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.67,1:38:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我 放开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me. Get off.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.04,1:38:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.48,1:38:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫醒其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and wake the others.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.39,1:39:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…\N{\fnArial\fs30}wha…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.15,1:39:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看到… - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you see… - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.28,1:39:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你相信… - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you believe… - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.82,1:39:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们可以… - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can we just… - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.60,1:39:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些家伙是干嘛的？僧侣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are these guys? Priests.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.50,1:39:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莫顿的僧侣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imhotep's priests.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.94,1:39:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right then.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.49,1:40:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.49,1:40:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 太阳神老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, horus, old boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.70,1:40:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,该关门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to close the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.81,1:41:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.44,1:41:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,安苏娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anck-su-namun.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.32,1:41:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧康诺 强纳森\N{\fnArial\fs30}O'connell! Jonathan!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.40,1:42:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可恶 这些家伙还真难缠 - 继续挖\N{\fnArial\fs30}- These guys just don't quit, do they? - Keep digging.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.53,1:42:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳金经\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! The book of amun-ra.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.14,1:42:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了怪物 把女孩救出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save the girl. Kill the creature. Aaaah!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.47,1:42:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在等什么？快走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you waiting for? Get out! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.76,1:43:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right? Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.28,1:43:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你的牺牲 安苏娜将复生\N{\fnArial\fs30}With your death, Anck-su-namun shall live.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.79,1:43:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我将所向无敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I shall be invincible!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.46,1:44:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳金经 我找到了 伊芙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The book of amun-ra! I found it, evy! I found it!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.33,1:44:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳金经\N{\fnArial\fs30}The book of amun-ra.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.96,1:44:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 救我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up and get me off here, Jonathan!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.90,1:44:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,把书打开 那是我们唯一的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the book, jonathan. It's the only way to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.67,1:44:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开金经 找到那道符咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to open the book and find the inscription.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.80,1:44:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打不开 好像锁住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can't open it! It's locked or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.18,1:44:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们需要钥匙 - 钥匙在他袍子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need the key, evy! - It's inside his robes.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.35,1:44:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欧康诺 - 欧康诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Haah! - O'connell!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.52,1:45:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,木乃伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mummies. Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.67,1:45:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 下面还有…欧康诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out! There's one down… o'connell!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.16,1:45:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到符咒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's an inscription.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.12,1:45:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,守陵…守陵侍卫听命\N{\fnArial\fs30}rasheem… rasheem oola rasheem oola kashka!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.75,1:46:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.76,1:46:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.86,1:46:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况是越来越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}This just keeps getting better and better. Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.86,1:46:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 强纳森 快想办法 - 我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do something, jonathan. - Me?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.20,1:46:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可以命令他们 - 你一定在开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can command them. - You have got to be joking.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.75,1:46:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨蛋 把封面上的符咒念完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finish the inscription on the cover, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.02,1:46:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就可以控制他们 对 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you can control them. Oh. Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.96,1:46:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.28,1:47:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,强纳森 赶快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up, jonathan!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.71,1:47:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我看不懂这最后一个符号 - 看起来像什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't figure out this last symbol. - What does it look like?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.56,1:47:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一只…鸟…一只鹳\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a, uh, a bird… a stork!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.91,1:48:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,妖…孽\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ahmenophus!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.38,1:48:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 原来如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.53,1:48:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 铲除妖孽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, hootash im ahmenophus.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.18,1:48:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,消灭他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroy him!!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.38,1:48:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,消灭他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroy him!!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.65,1:48:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我命令你们消灭他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I command you to destroy him!!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.52,1:49:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我命令你们消灭安苏娜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fa-kooshka Anck-su-namun!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.93,1:49:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,安苏娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anck-su-namun!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.97,1:49:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,把书交出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that book!!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.71,1:49:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莫顿 安苏娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anck-su-namun!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.88,1:49:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的死期到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you die.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.94,1:49:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊芙 我拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evy! I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.88,1:49:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 分散他的注意力 - 啊 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keep him busy. - Aaah! Oof.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.28,1:50:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.06,1:50:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快 伊芙 赶快\N{\fnArial\fs30}hurry, evy!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.36,1:50:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要催我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry! You're not helping.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.84,1:50:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在轮到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.77,1:50:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.61,1:50:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,尘归尘 土归土\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kadeesh mal. Kadeesh mal.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.61,1:50:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,该走的 不当留\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pared oos. Pared oos.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.31,1:50:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说这样就可以杀死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said it was gonna kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.39,1:51:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有法力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's mortal.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.96,1:51:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Death…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.96,1:51:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is only the beginning."
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.56,1:52:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to go. Ohh!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.30,1:52:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把书掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've lost the book!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.30,1:52:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不敢相信… - 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jonathan, I can't believe… - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.37,1:53:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们可以… - 不行 强纳森\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Couldn't we just… - No, jonathan!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.14,1:53:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧康诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}O'connell!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.53,1:53:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欧康诺 等我 - 过来 赶快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- O'connell! Wait! - Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.72,1:53:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.69,1:53:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on! Beni!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.22,1:53:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了 班尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good-bye, beni.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.86,1:54:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开 走开…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go away. Shoosh ma! Shoosh ma!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.94,1:54:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开 不要过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Shoosh ma! Shoosh ma!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.45,1:54:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要过来 走开…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoosh ma! Get away!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.03,1:54:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out, look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.44,1:55:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 真是谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Thank you. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.85,1:55:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我的族人衷心的感激你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've earned the respect and gratitude of me and my people.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.75,1:55:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well, it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.92,1:55:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿真神保佑你们平安\N{\fnArial\fs30}May allah smile upon you always.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.82,1:55:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也…一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And… Yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.30,1:55:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,随时效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, anytime.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.97,1:55:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,保重了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stayout of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.20,1:55:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就这样…丢下我们不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just… Leaving us here.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.31,1:56:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们又再度…空手而归\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess we go home empty-handed… Again.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.11,1:56:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒不觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:07.99,1:56:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.63,1:56:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？亲爱的 要不要亲一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}How 'bout you, darling? Would you like a little kissy-wissy?
